sequenceDiagram
  participant V as VS Code extension
  participant B as Embed init listener
  participant A as App shell and state
  participant G as GitHub client
  participant E as Markdown editor
  V->>A: load appBase/?embed=true in a webview frame (default mardoc.app)
  A->>V: postMessage ready to the parent (target *)
  V->>B: init from the webview wrapper, token only if a GitHub session exists
  B->>A: applyInitData
  A->>G: initOctokit(token), token kept in memory only
  A->>E: local file content
  E-->>V: file:save with Markdown on save
